                            </div>
                        </td>
                        <td>Stores energy in an electric field and resists sudden changes in voltage.</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="fw-bold text-primary">Voltage Source</td>
                        <td class="text-center py-3 bg-white">
                            <div class="d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center gap-3">
                                <div>
                                    <svg viewBox="0 0 60 55" style="width: 50px; height: 45px;">
