                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <svg viewBox="0 0 60 55" style="width: 50px; height: 45px;">
                                        <line x1="30" y1="5" x2="30" y2="18" stroke="#dc3545" stroke-width="2"/>
                                        <line x1="16" y1="18" x2="44" y2="18" stroke="#dc3545" stroke-width="3"/>
                                        <line x1="22" y1="26" x2="38" y2="26" stroke="#dc3545" stroke-width="2"/>
                                        <line x1="16" y1="34" x2="44" y2="34" stroke="#dc3545" stroke-width="3"/>
                                        <line x1="22" y1="42" x2="38" y2="42" stroke="#dc3545" stroke-width="2"/>
                                        <line x1="30" y1="42" x2="30" y2="52" stroke="#dc3545" stroke-width="2"/>
                                        <text x="50" y="22" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" fill="#dc3545">+</text>
                                        <text x="50" y="44" font-size="13" font-weight="bold" fill="#dc3545">-</text>
                                    </svg>
                                    <div class="small text-muted">DC Battery</div>
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <svg viewBox="0 0 60 55" style="width: 50px; height: 45px;">
                                        <circle cx="30" cy="27" r="18" fill="none" stroke="#dc3545" stroke-width="2.5"/>
                                        <text x="30" y="22" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle" fill="#dc3545">+</text>
                                        <text x="30" y="38" font-size="14" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle" fill="#dc3545">-</text>
                                    </svg>
                                    <div class="small text-muted">DC Independent</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </td>
                        <td>Provides a fixed voltage across its terminals, pushing current through the circuit.</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="fw-bold text-primary">Current Source</td>
                        <td class="text-center py-3 bg-white">
                            <div class="d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center gap-4">
                                <div>
                                    <svg viewBox="0 0 65 55" style="width: 55px; height: 45px;">
                                        <circle cx="32" cy="27" r="18" fill="none" stroke="#212529" stroke-width="2.5"/>
                                        <line x1="32" y1="38" x2="32" y2="17" stroke="#212529" stroke-width="2"/>
